## Developer Tools

There are several pre-defined command-recipes available.
They are written for the command runner [just](https://github.com/casey/just/).
To list all pre-defined commands, run `just` or `just --list`.
{%- if add_lokf %}

## LOKF knowledge base

This project ships a [LOKF](https://lokf.nolan-nichols.com) knowledge base under
[knowledge/](knowledge/): markdown concepts with YAML frontmatter that are also
a queryable RDF graph. The `lokf` toolkit is available via `lokf-*` recipes:

* `just lokf-build` — regenerate LOKF artifacts and validate the bundle
* `just lokf-serve` — SPARQL endpoint + live graph explorer
* `just lokf-convert` — project the bundle to RDF (Turtle)
* `just lokf-query '<SPARQL>'` — query the bundle
* `just lokf-tables` — project the bundle to linked tables
* `just lokf-export` — write `graph.json` + `datasets.jsonld` for a static site

Run `just --list` to see all LOKF recipes.
{%- endif %}

